  "_comment_webfonts": "The Arabic faces the repository already ships, embedded into every render as data URIs. Arabic is a joined script and a missing system font is invisible to the DOM fit report, so the frame must not depend on what the host happens to have installed. The Latin faces are declared first and the Arabic ones after with a unicode-range, so Arabic text takes the Arabic subset and NEXORA and the URL keep the Latin one.",
